        <https://example.org/dmo/id/observation/EHR-LAB-TC00328-SUB02-STATE>,
        <https://example.org/dmo/id/observation/EHR-LAB-TC00328-SUB03>,
        <https://example.org/dmo/id/observation/EHR-LAB-TC00328-SUB03-STATE>,
